silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_05_sections_02_concrete_anchor_3#nodetypenewvalue silm:hasLongDescription "The NodeTypeNewValue is the type tag for new value-nodes on existing quality legs. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'NewValue', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
